          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\angle AOD&=\\angle AOB+\\angle BOC+\\angle COD\\\\\\angle AOD&=27^\\circ+34^\\circ+44^\\circ\\\\\\angle AOD&=105^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
